  "title": "Garden Veggie Pizza Squares",
  "description": "Make pizza squares with pre-packaged crescent roll dough that gets baked into a single rectangle, then topped with ranch dressing-spiked cream cheese and crunchy vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "Meghan Brand"
  ],
